{{!
    @template tool_vae/history_page

    The page of the versions of a section, below its heading: the section, the way back, then "no version yet", or the form
    that compares two versions and one small form per version that can be restored, outside it (a form cannot hold
    another). The hidden fields of a form touch: those line breaks are carried by comments.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\history_page. The template holds no logic. The texts are
    escaped (double braces). Two keys are HTML (triple braces): emptyhtml, a notification of the core
    ($output->notification()); tablehtml, the table drawn by the template tool_vae/table (its fields by
    tool_vae/history_cell).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * line - string, the section or the work situation
    * back - false, or an object {url, label}: the way back
    * emptyhtml - false, or HTML: no version yet
    * compare - false, or an object {action, draftid, tablehtml, label}: the form that compares two versions
    * restores - array of objects {action, id, sesskey, number, workingat}: the forms that restore a version

    Example context (json):
    {
        "line": "Section: Objectives",
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/section.php", "label": "Back to the section"},
        "emptyhtml": false,
        "compare": {"action": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/compare.php", "draftid": 5,
            "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tr><td>Version 2</td></tr></table>", "label": "Compare"},
        "restores": [{"action": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/history.php?draftid=5", "id": "tool-vae-restore-1",
            "sesskey": "abc", "number": 1, "workingat": 0}]
    }
}}
<p>{{line}}</p>
{{#back}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/back}}
{{#emptyhtml}}
{{{emptyhtml}}}
{{/emptyhtml}}
{{#compare}}
<form method="get" action="{{action}}"><input type="hidden" name="draftid" value="{{draftid}}">
{{{tablehtml}}}
<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">{{label}}</button>
</form>
{{/compare}}
{{#restores}}
<form method="post" action="{{action}}" id="{{id}}"><input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">{{!
}}<input type="hidden" name="action" value="restore"><input type="hidden" name="number" value="{{number}}">{{!
}}<input type="hidden" name="workingat" value="{{workingat}}"></form>
{{/restores}}
